        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>中小学教师类 (D类)</title>\n<style>\n    :root {\n        --bg-color: #fcf4e3;\n        --grid-color: #eaddcb;\n        --board-color: #5c4140;\n        --yellow-page: #f6ae33;\n        --white-page: #ffffff;\n        --text-main: #333333;\n        --red-accent: #d82b2b;\n        --header-red: #d3554e;\n        --header-text: #ffe946;\n        --pink-tab: #ff8ca3;\n        --yellow-tab: #ffd560;\n    }\n\n    body {\n        margin: 0;\n        padding: 40px 20px;\n        background-color: var(--bg-color);\n        background-image: \n            linear-gradient(var(--grid-color) 1px, transparent 1px),\n            linear-gradient(90deg, var(--grid-color) 1px, transparent 1px);\n        background-size: 20px 20px;\n        font-family: \"PingFang SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"Helvetica Neue\", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\n        color: var(--text-main);\n        display: flex;\n        justify-content: center;\n        align-items: center;\n        min-height: 100vh;\n    }\n\n    .main-container {\n        position: relative;\n        width: 100%;\n        max-width: 600px;\n    }\n\n    .board {\n        position: relative;\n        background-color: var(--board-color);\n        border-radius: 20px;\n        padding: 12px 12px 25px 12px;\n        box-shadow: 0 10px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);\n        z-index: 10;\n    }\n\n    .yellow-layer {\n        background-color: var(--yellow-page);\n        border-radius: 15px;\n        padding: 0 0 15px 0;\n        position: relative;\n    }\n\n    .white-layer {\n        background-color: var(--white-page);\n        border-radius: 15px;\n        padding: 60px 40px 40px 40px;\n        position: relative;\n        box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);\n    }\n\n    /* Header Banner */\n    .header-banner {\n        position: absolute;\n        top: -30px;\n        left: 50%;\n        transform: translateX(-50%);\n        background-color: var(--header-red);\n        border-radius: 50px;\n        padding: 12px 45px;\n        z-index: 20;\n        white-space: nowrap;\n        box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);\n    }\n\n    .header-banner h1 {\n        margin: 0;\n        color: var(--header-text);\n        font-size: 28px;\n        font-weight: bold;\n        letter-spacing: 2px;\n        text-shadow: 1px 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);\n    }\n\n    .header-decor {\n        position: absolute;\n        bottom: -12px;\n        left: 20px;\n        width: 0; \n        height: 0; \n        border-left: 10px solid transparent;\n        border-right: 10px solid transparent;\n        border-top: 15px solid #f6ae33;\n        transform: rotate(30deg);\n        z-index: -1;\n    }\n    \n    .header-decor::after {\n        content: '';\n        position: absolute;\n        top: -15px;\n        left: -5px;\n        width: 10px;\n        height: 10px;\n        background: #fff;\n        border-radius: 50%;\n    }\n\n    /* Left Binding Rings */\n    .binding-rings {\n        position: absolute;\n        left: -8px;\n        top: 60px;\n        bottom: 60px;\n        display: flex;\n        flex-direction: column;\n        justify-content: space-between;\n        z-index: 15;\n    }\n\n    .ring-pair {\n        display: flex;\n        flex-direction: column;\n        gap: 5px;\n    }\n\n    .ring {\n        width: 26px;\n        height: 6px;\n        background-color: var(--board-color);\n        border-radius: 4px;\n        position: relative;\n    }\n    \n    .ring::after {\n        content: '';\n        position: absolute;\n        top: 1px;\n        left: 2px;\n        right: 2px;\n        height: 1px;\n        background-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.3);\n    }\n\n    /* Right Tabs */\n    .tab {\n        position: absolute;\n        right: -10px;\n        width: 25px;\n        border-radius: 0 5px 5px 0;\n        z-index: 5;\n    }\n\n    .tab-pink {\n        top: 120px;\n        height: 45px;\n        background-color: var(--pink-tab);\n    }\n\n    .tab-yellow {\n        top: 180px;\n        height: 45px;\n        background-color: var(--yellow-tab);\n    }\n\n    /* Typography & Layout */\n    .content-section {\n        margin-bottom: 25px;\n    }\n\n    .section-title {\n        font-weight: bold;\n        font-size: 17px;\n        margin-bottom: 15px;\n        color: #000;\n    }\n\n    p {\n        margin: 0 0 12px 0;\n        line-height: 1.8;\n        font-size: 15px;\n        text-align: justify;\n    }\n\n    .bullet-point {\n        position: relative;\n        padding-left: 22px;\n        margin-bottom: 12px;\n        line-height: 1.8;\n        font-size: 15px;\n        text-align: justify;\n    }\n\n    .bullet-point::before {\n        content: '';\n        position: absolute;\n        left: 0;\n        top: 7px;\n        width: 0;\n        height: 0;\n        border-top: 6px solid transparent;\n        border-bottom: 6px solid transparent;\n        border-left: 10px solid var(--red-accent);\n    }\n\n    strong {\n        font-weight: bold;\n        color: #000;\n    }\n\n    .dashed-line {\n        border: none;\n        border-top: 1px dashed #dcdcdc;\n        margin: 15px 0;\n    }\n\n    /* Footer */\n    .footer-note {\n        text-align: right;\n        margin-top: 10px;\n        font-size: 13px;\n        color: #555;\n        padding-right: 15px;\n    }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"main-container\">\n    <div class=\"board\">\n        <!-- Right sticky tabs -->\n        <div class=\"tab tab-pink\"></div>\n        <div class=\"tab tab-yellow\"></div>\n\n        <!-- Left binding rings -->\n        <div class=\"binding-rings\">\n            <div class=\"ring-pair\"><div class=\"ring\"></div><div class=\"ring\"></div></div>\n            <div class=\"ring-pair\"><div class=\"ring\"></div><div class=\"ring\"></div></div>\n            <div class=\"ring-pair\"><div class=\"ring\"></div><div class=\"ring\"></div></div>\n            <div class=\"ring-pair\"><div class=\"ring\"></div><div class=\"ring\"></div></div>\n            <div class=\"ring-pair\"><div class=\"ring\"></div><div class=\"ring\"></div></div>\n            <div class=\"ring-pair\"><div class=\"ring\"></div><div class=\"ring\"></div></div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"yellow-layer\">\n            <div class=\"white-layer\">\n                \n                <!-- Header -->\n                <div class=\"header-banner\">\n                    <div class=\"header-decor\"></div>\n                    <h1>中小学教师类 (D类)</h1>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Content -->\n                <div class=\"content-section\">\n                    <div class=\"section-title\">(一) 科目</div>\n                    <p>教育系统事业单位考试整体来说考试形式为<strong>公共科目+</strong> <strong>专业知识</strong>。</p>\n                    \n                    <div class=\"bullet-point\">\n                        <strong>公共科目包括:</strong>教育基础知识:教育学、心理学或教育心理学、教育法律法规、新课改或公共基础知识 (事业单位考试中的公基)。心理学与教育心理学并不相同,心理学通常称为普通心理学,教育心理学简称为教心。\n                    </div>\n                    <hr class=\"dashed-line\">\n                    \n                    <div class=\"bullet-point\">\n                        <strong>专业学科:</strong>一般来说一部分考核学科基础知识,另外一部分考核教学知识(教学设计、教学实施、教学评价)。\n                    </div>\n                    <hr class=\"dashed-line\">\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"content-section\">\n                    <div class=\"section-title\">(二) 题型</div>\n                    <p>教育理论知识的题型分为客观题和主观题两大类型。</p>\n                    \n                    <div class=\"bullet-point\">\n                        <strong>客观题</strong>主要是指单选题、多选题、不定项选择题、判断题、填空题等;\n                    </div>\n                    <hr class=\"dashed-line\">\n                    \n                    <div class=\"bullet-point\">\n                        <strong>主观题</strong>主要包括名词解释题、辨析题、简答题、论述题、材料/案例分析题、教学设计题(活动设计题)等。<strong>一般地域不同,题型也有所区别。</strong>\n                    </div>\n                    <hr class=\"dashed-line\">\n                </div>\n\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"footer-note\">\n        *线上课程面向22岁及以上\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
